Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.50,EN,,0,0,0,,Finance Exception Intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,财务异常智能。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.50,0:00:07.00,EN,,0,0,0,,See exceptions. Trace evidence. Coordinate action.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.50,0:00:07.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,发现异常，追溯证据，协同行动。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.00,0:00:10.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Five capabilities. One finance workspace.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.00,0:00:10.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,五项相互衔接的能力，一个财务工作空间。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:13.83,EN,,0,0,0,,Review reporting health. Open the Freight alert.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:13.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,总览报表状况，打开 Freight 预警。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.83,0:00:16.70,EN,,0,0,0,,A possible duplicate allocation needs finance review.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.83,0:00:16.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,可能存在重复分摊，需财务核实。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.70,0:00:21.40,EN,,0,0,0,,Identify records, correct duplicates, rerun, and validate Freight and GP.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.70,0:00:21.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,识别记录，修正重复分摊，重新运行，并验证 Freight 与毛利。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.40,0:00:28.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Review revenue, cost and source cost-credit trends.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.40,0:00:28.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,查看收入、成本及源成本抵减趋势。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.00,0:00:31.13,EN,,0,0,0,,Trace a separate allocation exception.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.00,0:00:31.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,追溯另一个独立的分摊异常。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.13,0:00:33.73,EN,,0,0,0,,GA's month-three gross profit is negative.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.13,0:00:33.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,GA 第三个月毛利为负。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.73,0:00:38.40,EN,,0,0,0,,Ask why gross profit turned negative.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.73,0:00:38.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,询问毛利为什么转为负数。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.40,0:00:43.77,EN,,0,0,0,,Follow the rules, true-up, revenue base, and source evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.40,0:00:43.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,依次追踪规则、轧差、收入基数和源凭证。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.77,0:00:45.87,EN,,0,0,0,,Open the negative revenue voucher.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.77,0:00:45.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,打开负收入凭证。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.87,0:00:48.87,EN,,0,0,0,,Check amount, segment, user and reference.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.87,0:00:48.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,核对金额、segment、入账人和参考号。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.87,0:00:50.87,EN,,0,0,0,,No confirmed sample offset.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.87,0:00:50.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,样例内未确认正向对冲。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.87,0:00:54.87,EN,,0,0,0,,LE's negative base raises GA's share and pressures GP.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.87,0:00:54.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,LE 负基数放大 GA 权重，影响毛利。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.87,0:00:58.57,EN,,0,0,0,,Compare excluding the voucher from the allocation base only.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.87,0:00:58.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,比较仅将凭证排除在分摊基数之外的方案。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.57,0:01:03.30,EN,,0,0,0,,Posted revenue and months one and two stay unchanged.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.57,0:01:03.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,已入账收入和前两个月的分摊结果不变。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.30,0:01:08.00,EN,,0,0,0,,GA improves; total GP unchanged; LE needs review.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.30,0:01:08.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,GA 改善，总毛利不变，LE 仍待核查。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.00,0:01:13.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Save the candidate and generate a report with evidence, assumptions, and actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.00,0:01:13.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,保存候选方案，生成包含证据、假设和行动的报告。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.00,0:01:18.13,EN,,0,0,0,,Turn proposals into accountable actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.00,0:01:18.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,将改善建议转化为责任明确的行动。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.13,0:01:20.10,EN,,0,0,0,,Assign an owner.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.13,0:01:20.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,分派负责人。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.10,0:01:22.23,EN,,0,0,0,,Confirm receipt.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.10,0:01:22.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,确认任务已接收。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.23,0:01:27.23,EN,,0,0,0,,Start work and track the handoff.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.23,0:01:27.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,开始处理并追踪交接。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.23,0:01:28.40,EN,,0,0,0,,Record the outcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.23,0:01:28.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,记录处理结果。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.40,0:01:30.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Ledger unchanged.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.40,0:01:30.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,账务保持不变。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.00,0:01:37.53,EN,,0,0,0,,Understand the logic behind the numbers. Ask the report.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.00,0:01:37.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,理解数字背后的逻辑，直接询问报表规则。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.53,0:01:42.50,EN,,0,0,0,,The simulated answer excerpt includes source citations.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.53,0:01:42.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,查看模拟回答片段及其来源引用。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.50,0:01:45.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Explore built-in and personal knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.50,0:01:45.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,查看内置和个人知识库。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.00,0:01:52.37,EN,,0,0,0,,Build monitors around your questions. Choose scope and metrics.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.00,0:01:52.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,围绕业务问题创建监控，选择范围和指标。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.37,0:01:57.30,EN,,0,0,0,,Review the chart, then set a gross-profit threshold.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.37,0:01:57.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,查看图表，再设置毛利阈值。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.30,0:02:02.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Add a revenue trend.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.30,0:02:02.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,添加收入趋势。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.00,0:02:05.17,EN,,0,0,0,,Drag to arrange your monitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.00,0:02:05.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,拖动卡片，调整监控布局。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.17,0:02:07.50,EN,,0,0,0,,Reuse templates.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.17,0:02:07.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,复用监控模板。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.50,0:02:11.50,EN,,0,0,0,,One workspace. From reporting signals to accountable action.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.50,0:02:11.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,一个工作空间，从报表信号走向可追踪的行动。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.50,0:02:14.50,EN,,0,0,0,,Finance Exception Intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.50,0:02:14.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,财务异常智能。
